{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/promethean-the-created-aa/1265506-so-what-do-praecipitati-last-more-than-one-scene-now","id":1265506,"title":"So what, do Praecipitati last more than one scene now?","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","Chronicles of Darkness","Promethean: The Created"],"posts":[{"date":"2018-11-08T07:18:48-08:00","id":1265506,"title":"So what, do Praecipitati last more than one scene now?","content":"Core says they only last one scene. Yet there are two here and talked about as if they last more than one scene. Is this a change, or error, or what?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/11876-deinos","name":"Deinos","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"311"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-11-08T07:31:07-08:00","id":1265508,"title":"","content":"Short answer: yes.<br /> <br /> Long answer: We wanted to include <i>praecipati</i> in Tormented, and the moment we included a history for them (ie how they were created) that also meant they existed for more than one scene. Not to mention that plothooks and rumours required an existence longer than 1 scene. And without those things, they're just <i>stats</i> and not really valuable enough to include in a Night Horrors book.<br /> <br /> Both come with reasons why they breaks the mold though--Cuvier has a <i>sublimatus</i> patron keeping it fed (providing the fuel for physical coherence), while Project Ishtar <i>is</i> partially <i>sublimatus</i> (providing mental coherence). Up to you if you want to use them in a game, or stick to the core rule of 1 scene only.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><span style=\"color:#008000\"><b>Freelance Author and Developer for Onyx Path Publishing</b></span>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":5}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1713-mistress-of-whispers","name":"mistress of whispers","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1713_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"103"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-11-08T08:46:26-08:00","id":1265514,"title":"","content":"Good to know, thank you!","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/11876-deinos","name":"Deinos","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"311"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-11-10T05:16:13-08:00","id":1266157,"title":"","content":"What are Praecipitati, in general?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1437-wyrdhamster","name":"wyrdhamster","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1437_5.jpg","title":"Banned","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"11313"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-11-10T06:54:23-08:00","id":1266174,"title":"","content":"Horrific fusions of multiple pandorans, but as they take a week or so to create and only last one scene, they are close to unusable in a storyline, unless there are special circumstances.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/11876-deinos","name":"Deinos","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank